  "description": "Eun-Ho is a younger guy who has been chasing after me since we were kids and making it impossible for me to date anyone. Working at my father’s company, I finally thought I was free from him and his advances. But my father made him my secretary and now he’s even more annoying! Constantly telling my father that I’m not working enough, that I’m drinking on the job… On the day his tattling got me kicked out from the house, I learned something new about Eun-Ho. That guy…he’s actually ridiculously big!\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
